{"3874300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Go Ahead", "steam_appid": 3874300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead is a third-person action-challenge game where you control various test subjects submitted to extreme reflex, coordination, and timing experiments. Set in a clinical, sterile lab environment, the game places you in a series of deadly rooms designed to make you fail — or force you to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage simulates a different phase of a brutal experiment: pixel-perfect jumps, timed traps, moving lasers, rotating blades, and collapsing platforms create a relentless testing ground for both body and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COOP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face extreme experiments in cooperative mode. Synchronization, timing and decision-making as a duo are essential, as any failure compromises both. Survival depends on collective precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerion tolerates no failure. Any mistake means immediate elimination, with a single strike. Behind the tests lies a relentless pursuit of peak reflexes and physical agility, ignoring any ethical limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being watched</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by whom?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead is a third-person action-challenge game where you control various test subjects submitted to extreme reflex, coordination, and timing experiments. Set in a clinical, sterile lab environment, the game places you in a series of deadly rooms designed to make you fail — or force you to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage simulates a different phase of a brutal experiment: pixel-perfect jumps, timed traps, moving lasers, rotating blades, and collapsing platforms create a relentless testing ground for both body and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COOP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face extreme experiments in cooperative mode. Synchronization, timing and decision-making as a duo are essential, as any failure compromises both. Survival depends on collective precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerion tolerates no failure. Any mistake means immediate elimination, with a single strike. Behind the tests lies a relentless pursuit of peak reflexes and physical agility, ignoring any ethical limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being watched</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.poster.avif?t=1773677750\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.webm?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.mp4?t=1773677750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by whom?</p>", "short_description": "A third-person action game that challenges your reflexes and reasoning with deadly traps, puzzles, and precision. Overcome extreme laboratory trials and discover what awaits you beyond the next step.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/9bcd9f32e3400faaf3d5745e3d36fd9e2a41c516/header.jpg?t=1773677750", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/f5ebff6bc952bb323174764430975379b04b13f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773677750", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/f5ebff6bc952bb323174764430975379b04b13f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773677750", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1600 / i3 9100f <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 470 / GTX 1050Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 3700 / i5 10400f <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></